{'symbol': 'NSC', 'date': '2022-10-26 08:15:00', 'title': 'NORFOLK SOUTHERN REPORTS THIRD QUARTER 2022 FINANCIAL RESULTS', 'text': 'POSTS QUARTERLY FINANCIAL RECORDS, IMPROVED SERVICE FOR CUSTOMERS ATLANTA , OCT. 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NORFOLK SOUTHERN CORPORATION (NYSE: NSC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THIRD QUARTER 2022 FINANCIAL RESULTS WHICH INCLUDED RECORDS FOR RAILWAY OPERATING REVENUES, INCOME FROM RAILWAY OPERATIONS, NET INCOME, AND DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE. THIRD QUARTER RAILWAY OPERATING REVENUE WAS $3.3 BILLION, INCOME FROM RAILWAY OPERATIONS WAS $1.3 BILLION, NET INCOME WAS $958 MILLION, AND DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE WERE $4.10.'}